        <mxCell id="v38" value="&lt;b&gt;event [guard] / action&lt;/b&gt;; transition IDs T01&amp;#8211;T26 are rows of transition_table.csv.&lt;br&gt;Bold border = terminal state (no further transitions; record kept).&lt;br&gt;&amp;#9671; choice pseudostate. &lt;b&gt;H&lt;/b&gt; = shallow history of IN_PROGRESS: dispute_withdrawn restores the previous_state stored in dispute_opened (ADR-0004).&lt;br&gt;Border arrows apply to every substate of the composite (T23: except RETURNED, team decision D4).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;it.2&lt;/b&gt; = drawn for completeness, built in iteration 2 (scheduler / extensions); faded.&lt;br&gt;Lifecycle state &amp;#8800; assurance state: the assurance state is an attribute of the Assessment (e.g. HELD_FOR_REVIEW with REVIEW_RECOMMENDED, ES-04)." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=9.5;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#1d1d1d;spacing=2;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1">
